        "attack": "双叉枪直刺，造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<><#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。<#ff9028ff>伊科尔<>：放完技能后<#ffb900ff>3秒<>内，下一次普攻额外造成<#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<><#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。",
